                            {
                                "example_id": "184fc522-1074-4037-ae2b-1a21441b3366",
                                "sense_id": "73b693a2-f09c-3e44-9e9b-2dfaef36d97c",
                                "text": "Ghy hebt oud Troien thans, maer ick al lang sien vallen:\nVan zedert soo verwoed, rondom de staende wallen,\nMet sijn' strijdwagen styf, en wacker aengesweept,\nDe wreede Peleus soon mijn' leden heeft gesleept:",
                                "translation": "You have old Troy for now, but I [have] long seen it fall\nFrom since, so enraged, round the [still] standing walls,\nWith his sturdy chariot and driven fiercely,\nThe cruel son of Peleus has dragged my [better half's] body:",
                                "english": "You have old Troy for now, but I [have] long seen it fall\nFrom since, so enraged, round the [still] standing walls,\nWith his sturdy chariot and driven fiercely,\nThe cruel son of Peleus has dragged my [better half's] body:"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
